glfw
------------------------------------------
GLFW is a free, Open Source, multi-platform library for OpenGL and OpenGL ES
application development. It provides a simple, platform-independent API for
creating windows and contexts, reading input, handling events, etc.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libglfw-devel-3.5.1-1bl1
  libglfw3-3.5.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libX11-devel-1.8.13-1
  libXcursor-devel-1.2.3-1
  libXext-devel-1.3.7-1
  libXi-devel-1.8.3-1
  libXinerama-devel-1.1.6-1
  libXrandr-devel-1.5.5-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/glfw/glfw

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/glfw/glfw/archive/refs/tags/3.5.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack glfw-3.5.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./glfw-3.5.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/glfw-3.5.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/glfw-3.5.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libglfw3-3.5.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libglfw-devel-3.5.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(glfw)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/glfw.README
  /usr/share/doc/glfw/CONTRIBUTORS.md
  /usr/share/doc/glfw/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/glfw/README.md

(libglfw3)
  /usr/bin/cygglfw-3.dll

(libglfw-devel)
  /usr/include/GLFW/glfw3.h
  /usr/include/GLFW/glfw3native.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/glfw3/glfw3Config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/glfw3/glfw3ConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/glfw3/glfw3Targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/glfw3/glfw3Targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libglfw.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/glfw3.pc

